- {{{ #!vex // Parameters vector frequency = chv("frequency"); float amplitude = chf("amplitude"); vector offset = chv("offset"); float threshold = chf("threshold"); float depth = chf("depth"); int seed; float f1, ... (11 October 2026)
- // Noise values wnoise(v@P * frequency + offset, seed, f1, f2, f3, f4); float noise_value = f1 * amplitude; (11 October 2026)
- // Create mask if (noise_value > threshold) { @height = depth; } }}} (11 October 2026)
- The terrain is quite large and most probably you need small parameter values. (11 October 2026)
